# Final Certification Authority (ABSOLUTE P0)

## Never declare without all questions TRUE

COMPLETE · FINAL CERTIFIED · FREEZE/COMMIT/PUSH/PREVIEW/PRODUCTION READY — **forbidden** unless every gate below PASSes.

## Questions

1. Rebuild tomorrow → same canonical implementation? YES=PASS · NO=not certified  
2. Any known unresolved issue? NO=PASS · YES=not certified  
3. Obvious improvement now without changing Owner-approved implementation? NO=PASS · YES=implement → re-audit  
4. Scale via optimize-in-place · zero duplication? YES=PASS · NO=not certified  
5. All ROVEXO principles 100% YES? (one implementation · one SSOT · zero duplications · real verification · 100/100 · optimize before rebuild · protect before modify · Owner design wins · zero regressions · full width/responsive/adaptive 100%)  

## Final question

Would the Owner approve this page again today without changing its canonical implementation?  
YES → **FINAL CERTIFIED (100/100)** · NO → **NOT FINAL CERTIFIED**

## Meaning

**FINAL CERTIFIED** = nothing known broken/requiring redesign/duplication/rebuild · existing implementation is correct · all real + Owner gates passed · may evolve via optimization only.  
Does **not** mean never improve/optimize/fix bugs.

## Allowed final status only

**FINAL CERTIFIED (100/100)** · **or** · **NOT FINAL CERTIFIED**
